.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
# Docker ignore patterns are root-anchored (unlike .gitignore), so reaching
# frontend/ needs **/. The dashboard is built INSIDE the image from its
# lockfile: host node_modules and a host-built dist must never leak into the
# context (they would bloat it and could ship stale assets).
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
frontend/test-results/
frontend/playwright-report/
frontend/.playwright/
data/
keys/*_ed25519
keys/*.pub
.git/
.env
